---
import cases from '../research/physx.json';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
---
<section id="physics-adaptation" class="physx-section not-prose full-bleed" data-base={base}>
  <div class="physx-wrap">
    <p class="physx-eyebrow">Physical asset generation <span>03 / 03</span></p>
    <div class="physx-heading"><div><h2>From image to physical asset<span>.</span></h2><p>Explore PhysX-Omni's generated geometry, part descriptions, and physical asset exports across three object categories.</p></div><a href="https://github.com/ziangcao0312/PhysX-Omni" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="source-link">PhysX-Omni ↗</a></div>
    <div class="pipeline" aria-label="PhysX-Omni pipeline"><div><b>01</b><strong>Single image</strong><span>RGB input</span></div><div><b>02</b><strong>Physical understanding</strong><span>Parts · materials · properties</span></div><div><b>03</b><strong>Geometry decoding</strong><span>Part meshes</span></div><div><b>04</b><strong>Asset export</strong><span>URDF / MJCF</span></div></div>
    <div class="physx-explorer"><div class="physx-top"><div><span class="physx-label">Select a case</span><div class="physx-case-buttons" role="group" aria-label="Choose a PhysX-Omni case"><button type="button" data-physx="gso_hammer_v003" aria-pressed="true"><span class="case-icon" aria-hidden="true">✓</span> Hammer</button><button type="button" data-physx="gso_box_v004" aria-pressed="false"><span class="case-icon" aria-hidden="true">×</span> Box</button><button type="button" data-physx="gso_mug_v005" aria-pressed="false"><span class="case-icon" aria-hidden="true">×</span> Mug</button><button type="button" data-physx="partnet_microwave_7236" aria-pressed="false"><span class="case-icon" aria-hidden="true">×</span> Microwave</button><button type="button" data-physx="partnet_foldingchair_100526" aria-pressed="false"><span class="case-icon" aria-hidden="true">×</span> Folding chair</button><button type="button" data-physx="epfl_Lr_bottom_edge_0629" aria-pressed="false"><span class="case-icon" aria-hidden="true">×</span> Cloth 01</button><button type="button" data-physx="epfl_Lr_top_edge_2_0656" aria-pressed="false"><span class="case-icon" aria-hidden="true">×</span> Cloth 02</button><button type="button" data-physx="gso_bottle_v008" aria-pressed="false"><span class="case-icon" aria-hidden="true">✓</span> Bottle</button><button type="button" data-physx="gso_bowl_v008" aria-pressed="false"><span class="case-icon" aria-hidden="true">✓</span> Bowl</button><button type="button" data-physx="innerscene_frypan_v008" aria-pressed="false"><span class="case-icon" aria-hidden="true">✓</span> Frying pan</button><button type="button" data-physx="partnet_safe_101619" aria-pressed="false"><span class="case-icon" aria-hidden="true">×</span> Safe</button><button type="button" data-physx="epfl_tshirt_Ll_back_0376" aria-pressed="false"><span class="case-icon" aria-hidden="true">×</span> T-shirt</button></div></div><span id="physx-category" class="physx-pill">Rigid</span></div>
      <div class="physx-stage-grid"><div class="physx-stage"><div class="physx-stage-label"><span>Decoded parts</span><span>PhysX-Omni</span></div><model-viewer id="physx-viewer" src={`${base}/research/physx/gso_hammer_v003/prediction.glb`} alt="PhysX-Omni decoded hammer parts" camera-controls touch-action="pan-y" shadow-intensity="0.5" exposure="1" loading="lazy"></model-viewer><div class="physx-stage-bottom"><span id="physx-state" role="status">Loading 3D asset…</span><span>Drag to rotate · Scroll to zoom</span></div></div>
        <aside class="physx-input"><span class="physx-label">Input image</span><div class="physx-input-frame"><img id="physx-image" src={`${base}/research/physx/gso_hammer_v003/input.png`} alt="Hammer input" /></div><h3 id="physx-case-name">Hammer</h3><p id="physx-dataset">GSO32</p><div class="prediction"><span class="physx-label">Model description</span><strong id="physx-predicted-name">Mallet</strong><span id="physx-part-count">2 decoded parts</span></div></aside></div>
      <div class="physx-detail"><div><span class="physx-label">Predicted parts &amp; materials</span><ul id="physx-parts" class="physx-parts-list"></ul></div><div><span class="physx-label">Case review</span><div id="physx-review" aria-live="polite"></div></div></div>
      <section class="box-comparison" id="physx-box-comparison" hidden aria-label="Box input view comparison"><div class="box-comparison-heading"><span class="physx-label">Input view comparison</span><p>Two views of the same box produced different interpretations.</p></div><div class="followup-views"><article><img src={`${base}/research/physx/box-view-comparison/004.png`} alt="Box input view 004" loading="lazy"/><div><span>View 004</span><h4>× Table</h4><p>Tabletop and four legs</p></div></article><article><img src={`${base}/research/physx/box-view-comparison/007.png`} alt="Box input view 007" loading="lazy"/><div><span>View 007</span><h4>× Travel bag</h4><p>Handles and zippers</p></div></article></div></section>
      <details class="physx-property"><summary>Predicted physical properties <span>Per-part values　＋</span></summary><div class="physx-table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>Part</th><th>Material</th><th>Density (kg/m³)</th><th>Young’s modulus (GPa)</th><th>Poisson ratio</th></tr></thead><tbody id="physx-property-table"></tbody></table></div></details>
    </div>
    <div class="physx-evaluation"><div class="physx-eval-head"><div><p class="physx-eyebrow">Experiment results</p><h2><span id="physx-results-title">Twelve real inputs</span><span>.</span></h2><p>Geometry and export outcomes across rigid, articulated, and deformable cases.</p></div><div class="physx-stats"><div><b id="physx-stat-vlm">12 / 12</b><span>VLM outputs</span></div><div><b id="physx-stat-parts">39 / 39</b><span>Decoded parts</span></div><div><b id="physx-stat-issues">8 / 12</b><span>Cases with identified issues</span></div></div></div>
      <div class="physx-chart-legend" aria-label="Chart colors"><span><i class="legend-best"></i> Best displayed value</span><span><i></i> Other values</span></div>
      <div id="physx-metric-chart" class="physx-metric-carousel" aria-label="Physical asset metrics" tabindex="0"><article class="physx-metric"><div class="physx-metric-title"><h3>Chamfer-L1 ↓</h3><span>Lower is better</span></div><div id="physx-cd-chart"></div><div class="physx-axis"><span>0</span><span>0.12</span></div></article><article class="physx-metric"><div class="physx-metric-title"><h3>F-score @ 2% ↑</h3><span>Higher is better</span></div><div id="physx-fs-chart"></div><div class="physx-axis"><span>0%</span><span>100%</span></div></article><article class="physx-metric"><div class="physx-metric-title"><h3>Middle-side ratio error ↓</h3><span>Lower is better</span></div><div class="physx-row"><div class="physx-row-label"><span>Box</span><strong>37.3</strong></div><div class="physx-bar"><div class="physx-bar-fill" style="width:93.24999999999999%"></div></div></div><div class="physx-row"><div class="physx-row-label"><span>Mug</span><strong>4.2</strong></div><div class="physx-bar"><div class="physx-bar-fill" style="width:10.500000000000002%"></div></div></div><div class="physx-row"><div class="physx-row-label"><span>Hammer</span><strong>0.4</strong></div><div class="physx-bar"><div class="physx-bar-fill" style="width:1.0%"></div></div></div><div class="physx-row"><div class="physx-row-label"><span>Microwave</span><strong>7.7</strong></div><div class="physx-bar"><div class="physx-bar-fill" style="width:19.25%"></div></div></div><div class="physx-row"><div class="physx-row-label"><span>Folding chair</span><strong>3.3</strong></div><div class="physx-bar"><div class="physx-bar-fill" style="width:8.249999999999998%"></div></div></div><div class="physx-row"><div class="physx-row-label"><span>Cloth 01</span><strong>1.9</strong></div><div class="physx-bar"><div class="physx-bar-fill" style="width:4.75%"></div></div></div><div class="physx-row"><div class="physx-row-label"><span>Cloth 02</span><strong>29.4</strong></div><div class="physx-bar"><div class="physx-bar-fill" style="width:73.5%"></div></div></div><div class="physx-row"><div class="physx-row-label"><span>Bottle</span><strong>4.2</strong></div><div class="physx-bar"><div class="physx-bar-fill" style="width:10.500000000000002%"></div></div></div><div class="physx-row"><div class="physx-row-label"><span>Bowl</span><strong>0.2</strong></div><div class="physx-bar"><div class="physx-bar-fill is-best" style="width:0.5%"></div></div></div><div class="physx-row"><div class="physx-row-label"><span>Frying pan</span><strong>5.0</strong></div><div class="physx-bar"><div class="physx-bar-fill" style="width:12.5%"></div></div></div><div class="physx-row"><div class="physx-row-label"><span>Safe</span><strong>9.3</strong></div><div class="physx-bar"><div class="physx-bar-fill" style="width:23.25%"></div></div></div><div class="physx-row"><div class="physx-row-label"><span>T-shirt</span><strong>N/A</strong></div><div class="physx-bar"><div class="physx-bar-fill" style="width:0%"></div></div></div><div class="physx-axis"><span>0</span><span>40</span></div></article></div>

      <details class="physx-full"><summary>Full results <span><span id="physx-table-caption">All twelve cases</span>　＋</span></summary><div class="physx-table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>Case</th><th>Category</th><th>Decoded parts</th><th>CD-L1 ↓</th><th>F-score @ 2% ↑</th><th>Case review</th></tr></thead><tbody id="physx-table"></tbody></table></div><div class="calibration-note"><img src={`${base}/research/physx/calibration/input.png`} alt="Official dumpster example" loading="lazy"/><div><span class="physx-label">Official example</span><p>✓ Dumpster identified　<span class="calibration-error">× Two degenerate mesh faces</span></p></div></div></details>

      <p class="physx-protocol">Inputs: <a href="https://research.google/blog/scanned-objects-by-google-research-a-dataset-of-3d-scanned-common-household-items/">Google Scanned Objects</a> · <a href="https://www.innerscene.com/tools/library/3d-parts/frying-pan-fe1cb069">Innerscene</a> · <a href="https://huggingface.co/datasets/AlbertS666/PartNet-Mobility-USD">PartNet-Mobility-USD</a> · <a href="https://www.epfl.ch/labs/cvlab/data/texless-defsurf-data/">EPFL Texture-less Deformable Surfaces</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <script is:inline type="application/json" id="physx-cases" set:html={JSON.stringify(cases).replaceAll('<','\\u003c')} />
</section>
<script>
  import '@google/model-viewer';
  import '../research/physx.js';
</script>
<style is:global>
.physx-section{background:#f6f7f4;color:#141a19;padding:clamp(48px,6vw,88px) 24px;font-family:system-ui,sans-serif}.physx-wrap{max-width:1320px;margin:auto}.physx-eyebrow{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;border-top:1px solid #bdc8be;padding-top:14px;color:#47735c;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.12em}.physx-eyebrow span{color:#6c7772}.physx-heading{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:end;gap:24px;margin:34px 0}.physx-heading h2,.physx-eval-head h2{font-size:clamp(38px,5vw,64px);font-weight:650;letter-spacing:-.055em;line-height:1;color:#17251d;margin:0}.physx-heading h2 span,.physx-eval-head h2 span{color:#71a67c}.physx-heading p,.physx-eval-head>div>p:not(.physx-eyebrow){font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#69746d;margin:16px 0 0;max-width:670px}.source-link{white-space:nowrap;color:#527c5f;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none}.pipeline{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:1px;background:#dce3dd;border:1px solid #dce3dd;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;margin:35px 0 24px}.pipeline>div{background:#fff;padding:20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}.pipeline b,.physx-label{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.12em;color:#718077;font-weight:700}.pipeline strong{font-size:15px;color:#203c2c}.pipeline span{font-size:12px;color:#89968b}.box-comparison{padding:20px 22px;border-top:1px solid #e5eae6}.box-comparison[hidden]{display:none}.box-comparison-heading p{font-size:14px;color:#78847a;margin:8px 0 0}.followup-views{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px;margin-top:14px}.followup-views article{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:18px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #dce3dd;border-radius:12px;padding:16px}.followup-views img{width:120px;height:120px;object-fit:contain;background:#f1f3ef;border-radius:8px}.followup-views span{font-size:12px;color:#78847a}.followup-views h4{margin:7px 0;color:#b54b42;font-size:19px}.followup-views p{margin:0;font-size:13px;color:#67786b}.calibration-note{display:flex;gap:16px;align-items:center;margin:0 24px 24px;padding:16px;background:#f6f8f5;border-radius:8px}.calibration-note img{width:64px;height:64px;object-fit:contain;border-radius:7px}.calibration-note p{margin:7px 0 0;font-size:14px;color:#477d57}.calibration-error{color:#b54b42}.physx-explorer,.physx-metric,.physx-full,.physx-audit-grid article{border:1px solid #dce3dd;background:#fff;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden}.physx-top{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;padding:20px 22px}.physx-case-buttons{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin-top:10px}.physx-case-buttons button{border:1px solid #e1e7e2;background:white;border-radius:6px;padding:8px 12px;color:#657169;font-size:14px;cursor:pointer}.physx-case-buttons .case-icon{font-size:17px;font-weight:700;color:#b54b42}.physx-case-buttons .case-ok .case-icon{color:#477d57}.physx-case-buttons button[aria-pressed=true] .case-icon{color:inherit}.physx-review-line{display:flex;align-items:start;gap:8px;margin:8px 0 0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#47584c}.physx-review-icon{font-size:18px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.15}.physx-review-line.ok .physx-review-icon{color:#477d57}.physx-review-line.error .physx-review-icon{color:#b54b42}.physx-table-scroll td:last-child{white-space:normal;min-width:320px;line-height:1.5}.physx-case-buttons button[aria-pressed=true]{background:#203c2c;border-color:#203c2c;color:white}.physx-pill{border:1px solid #dae5da;border-radius:30px;padding:7px 10px;color:#62826b;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.1em;white-space:nowrap}.physx-stage-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 280px;border-top:1px solid #e5eae6;border-bottom:1px solid #e5eae6}.physx-stage{position:relative;min-width:0;background:#e9ede9}.physx-stage model-viewer{width:100%;height:490px;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at center,#f9faf8,#e5eae5);--poster-color:transparent}.physx-stage-label,.physx-stage-bottom{position:absolute;z-index:1;left:20px;rig